## ✅ Pre-Completion Checklist

Before marking any task complete, verify:

```bash
# 1. Lint check
pnpm run lint

# 2. Run all tests
pnpm test

# 3. Build validation
pnpm run build

# 4. Security audit (for dependency changes)
pnpm audit

# 5. Type check (should be covered by build)
npx tsc --noEmit

# 6. Verify no conflicting lock files
# Ensure package-lock.json and yarn.lock do not exist
ls package-lock.json yarn.lock 2>/dev/null && echo "ERROR: Remove conflicting lock files" || echo "✓ No conflicting lock files"

# 7. Verify pnpm-lock.yaml is up to date
git diff --exit-code pnpm-lock.yaml || echo "⚠️  pnpm-lock.yaml has changes - commit it"
```

**All must pass.** If any fail, fix issues before proceeding.

